# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Publication boundary.  Third-party copyrighted material is never committed:
# source PDFs and every citation page image.  The JSTOR page images also carry
# a watermark naming the downloading institution.  The dossier sources still
# build without them, with framed placeholders in place of each image, and
# fresh_audit_2026_08_16/render_evidence.sh regenerates the corpus from local
# copies of the sources, one pinned page per call.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
refs/
**/evidence/
part_ii/dossier_images/
*.png
*dossier*.pdf

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
!part_ii/*checkpoint.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store

# tracked by the private companion repository instead
PRIVATE.md

